			</heading>
			<begin-paragraph>
			</begin-paragraph>
			<v n="1">
				A good 
				<crossref let="b" cid="c20022001.1">
				</crossref>
				name is, 
				<crossref let="c" cid="c20022001.2">
				</crossref>
				to be chosen rather than great riches, and favor is better than silver or gold.
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20022002">
			</marker>
			<v n="2">
				The rich 
				<crossref let="d" cid="c20022002.3">
				</crossref>
				and the, 
				<crossref let="e" cid="c20022002.4">
				</crossref>
				poor meet together; the LORD is the Maker of them all.
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20022003">
			</marker>
			<v n="3">
				The prudent 
				<crossref let="f" cid="c20022003.5">
				</crossref>
				sees danger, 
				<crossref let="g" cid="c20022003.6">
				</crossref>
				and hides himself, but the simple go on and suffer for it.
				<note nid="n20022003.3">
				</note>
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20022004">
			</marker>
			<v n="4">
				The reward 
				<crossref let="h" cid="c20022004.7">
				</crossref>
				for humility, 
				<crossref let="i" cid="c20022004.8">
				</crossref>
				and fear of the LORD is riches and honor and life.(1)
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20022005">
			</marker>
			<v n="5">
				Thorns and 
				<crossref let="j" cid="c20022005.9">
				</crossref>
				snares are, 
				<crossref let="k" cid="c20022005.10">
				</crossref>
				in the way of the crooked; whoever guards his soul will keep far from them.
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20022006">
			</marker>
			<v n="6">
				Train up 
				<crossref let="l" cid="c20022006.11">
				</crossref>
				a child, 
				<crossref let="m" cid="c20022006.12">
				</crossref>
				in the way he should go; even when he is old he will not depart from it.
				<note nid="n20022006.6">
				</note>
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20022007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">
				The rich 
				<crossref let="n" cid="c20022007.13">
				</crossref>
				rules over, 
				<crossref let="o" cid="c20022007.14">
				</crossref>
