				<crossref let="s" cid="c20022022.44">
				</crossref>
				poor, because he is poor, or crush the afflicted at the gate,
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20022023">
			</marker>
			<v n="23">
				for the 
				<crossref let="t" cid="c20022023.45">
				</crossref>
