			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20022029">
			</marker>
			<v n="29">
				Do you 
				<crossref let="f" cid="c20022029.57">
				</crossref>
				see a, 
				<crossref let="g" cid="c20022029.58">
				</crossref>
				man skillful in his work? He will stand before kings; he will not stand before obscure men. Footnotes (1) 22:4 Or *The reward for humility is the fear of the Lord, riches and honor and life* (2) 22:9 Hebrew *good* (3) 22:14 Hebrew *strange* (ESV)
			</v>
